Synonyms: In UVEK2018 enthalten; 
UUID: 2d4b978b-3964-3cf1-9e52-62490882af1f
This module provides heat for end uses.
Location: Could be used for central European conditions
Technology: Efficiency of boiler of average technology available on the market
Time period: Time of publications.
Production volume: na
Sampling: heat efficieny based on literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_2d4b978b-3964-3cf1-9e52-62490882af1f.xml</text>
